  triage:title "verification schema does not semantically bind the check to the test case" ;
  triage:description "In scripts/smoke/run_peer_pair.py's new semantic-verification mechanism (added on feature/pAI-s15-windows-peer-smoke, commit 12f4b96e), the verification schema doesn't semantically bind the check to the specific test case -- a constant-JSON no-op verification stanza validates successfully regardless of actual case content." ;
